[agent] ## How I determined it
[agent] All work ran on the Databricks platform via the CLI:
[agent] 1. Uploaded `training_data.csv` to a UC volume in my run schema (`workspace.mlpab4b6179`).
[agent] 2. Loaded it into a table via the SQL warehouse (`read_files`).
[agent] 3. Computed per-feature Pearson correlation with the label, then class-conditional statistics.
